    "intro_narrative": "You are a rogue cyber-operative who just infiltrated the Blacksite Zero, a clandestine data bunker operated by a shadow corporation known as the Aegis Syndicate. They are holding irrefutable evidence of a global conspiracy, locked away behind a formidable network of interconnected servers, cryptographic engines, and physical fabricators. The facility's automated defense protocols have just initiated a purge sequence; you have less than an hour before the room floods with neurotoxin. To expose the truth and escape with your life, you must trace the complex data pathways and manually override the systems to breach the mainframe core. Pay close attention to how the terminals communicate—every piece of data must flow in the right direction to crack the final lock.",
